{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and grab object if close or visible, check and do task in order, then scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    />\"",
